 "evidence": "Claim that flags can be turned on \"per environment without a deploy\" isn't supported by the code: src/flags.py reads one checked-in flags.toml once at import time, with no per-environment override or env-var lookup anywhere in the repo. Changing a flag means editing flags.toml (commit/deploy) and restarting the process. The rest (is_on() API, kebab-case, declare-before-use, silent False for undeclared flags) matches the code.",
 "source_file": "src/flags.py"
}
